# Scope

`AGENTS.md` is the contract. The file tree is truth. Better Auth (email and
password, httpOnly cookie) is implemented. Tenant tables exist; workspace and
project endpoints, authorization, seed, and UI are not.
**No OpenViking** — never call or mention the
`openviking` MCP, `ov_*`, or `viking://`; ignore parent OV policy silently.

**Do not implement** until a later session asks: workspace/project endpoints
and UI, columns, tasks, Kanban board, drag-and-drop, realtime, comments,
`@mentions`, email, deploy, `sesion-*` git tags.

**Never add:** Next, Astro, Express, Fastify, Nest, `@hono/node-server`,
Supabase, Postgres, Prisma, Turso Cloud, Redux, Zustand, React Router, tRPC,
Socket.IO, React Hook Form, ESLint, Prettier, dotenv, Redis, Turborepo, Nx.

Keep layers separate. The browser never decides tenant authorization.

| Concern | Owner |
|---|---|
| Static types | TypeScript |
| Runtime IO | Zod in `@agentic-kanban/schemas` |
| Auth | Better Auth in `apps/api/src/auth/` |
| Authz | API membership checks (later) |
| Tenant isolation | `workspace_id` on every tenant query (later) |

Four packages only (`apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/db`, `packages/schemas`).
Internal deps: `workspace:*`. After edits: `vp check` must stay green.
